    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About these metrics",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Panels select metrics by **regex** (`{__name__=~\"claude_code_*\"}`) so they keep working across the OTEL->Prometheus name translation (`.`->`_`, counters get `_total`, unit suffixes like `_tokens`/`_USD` may be appended).\n\nIf a panel is empty: run Claude Code with telemetry enabled, then confirm the exact series names at Prometheus http://localhost:9090/graph and tweak the exprs. Metric names can shift between Claude Code versions."
      }
    },
    {
